    IDS_HELLO_FOOT          "Ko te whakatā me ngā tautuhinga — pāwhiri-matau i te tohu i te wāhi whakamōhiotanga. I ngā tautuhinga ka taea e koe te whakakā i te haki whakatakotoranga i te wāhi whakamōhiotanga."
